### PayPilot API examples. Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and IntelliJ's HTTP client.
### Start the stack first: .\run-local.ps1

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@merchantKey = pk_test_demo_merchant
@adminKey = sk_admin_demo_only

### Create a payment (run it twice: the second call is replayed, not charged again)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}
Idempotency-Key: order-1042-attempt-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 49900, "currency": "INR", "method": "UPI", "payer": "anishka@okaxis", "description": "Order #1042"}

### Same key, different amount -> 422 IDEMPOTENCY_KEY_REUSED
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}
Idempotency-Key: order-1042-attempt-1
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 99900, "currency": "INR", "method": "UPI", "payer": "anishka@okaxis", "description": "Order #1042"}

### A declined payment
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}
Idempotency-Key: order-2001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 150000, "currency": "INR", "method": "UPI", "payer": "decline@upi"}

### PSP times out -> 202 PROCESSING, resolved by the sweeper in ~10s
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}
Idempotency-Key: order-3001
Content-Type: application/json

{"amount": 30000, "currency": "INR", "method": "UPI", "payer": "timeout@upi"}

### Recent payments of this merchant
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments?limit=10
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}

### Attempts for a payment (paste an id)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments/pay_REPLACE_ME/attempts
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}

### Refund (paste an id)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/payments/pay_REPLACE_ME/refund
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}

### Take PSP alpha down (chaos)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/v1/ops/chaos/alpha
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"down": true, "declineRate": 0, "errorRate": 0, "timeoutRate": 0, "latencyMs": 50}

### Heal every PSP
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/ops/chaos/reset
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Ops stats across merchants
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/ops/stats
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Ledger: do the books balance?
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/ledger/integrity
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Ledger: account balances
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/ledger/accounts
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Merchant key on the ledger -> 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/ledger/accounts
X-Api-Key: {{merchantKey}}
